  "description": "A debt of 160 million won, and a tiny corner store in a shantytown to call home.\n\nSince childhood, Jeong Haeju has followed her father around, providing illegal house-call medical services to gangsters.\n\nThat was the life résumé of Haeju, who had just come of age that year. Her life was a complete mess, but to her, there was nothing particularly unusual about it.\n\nThen she meets Beom Geono, the CEO of a luxury hotel with the attitude of a gangster, and her life becomes even more unpredictable…\n\n“Hey, baby. Your man’s here.”\n\n…How the hell am I supposed to get rid of this lunatic?\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://ridibooks.com/books/1561017591)",
